### Status (scripts: Authorization header)
GET http://{{host}}/admin/status
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Hardware status (no auth)
GET http://{{host}}/admin/hw-status

### Start the pump for 30 minutes, then back to automatic control
POST http://{{host}}/admin/pump
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "start", "minutes": 30}

### Stop the pump for 60 minutes (refused with 409 while overheated)
POST http://{{host}}/admin/pump
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "stop", "minutes": 60}

### Back to automatic control
POST http://{{host}}/admin/pump
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "auto"}

### OTA update check
POST http://{{host}}/admin/su
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Reboot
POST http://{{host}}/admin/reboot
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Migrator (only while floor-heating-migrator runs): checks and stage
GET http://{{host}}/migrator

### Migrator: write the partition table and bootloader (READY stage only)
POST http://{{host}}/migrator/commit
Authorization: {{auth}}
